5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about the depot floor. Freight moves regardless of office projects. We need to see how our equipment actually handles the calendar.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I am concerned about the hidden costs. Headline prices lie. I need to see what keeps arriving after the initial contract is signed.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I suspect we will repeat past failures. Who is in charge when things break? And does the plan survive contact with reality?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I am curious about our history. Systems age quietly, and outside work often comes back broken. I want to see the scars.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,I worry about our people. The ones holding it together are leaving or stretched thin. How will this land on them?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Mizuki, hidden costs are real, but if the yard scanners fail, we stop moving. I need to check the physical reality first.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Kenji, physical failure is a cost. I will look at the renewal invoices to see where the money actually goes over time.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, history is a mirror. I need to know if support ownership is clear. I will check the last winter's outage records.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I agree. I will look at the 2018 pay move data lift to see how outside work really landed.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Kenji, the yard is vital, but the people running it are more fragile. I will check the administrator retirements and hiring times.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I hear you. But I need to know if the yard devices can handle the new system. I will check the 2021 scheduling trial.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Asuka, support gaps are expensive. I will also look at the board minutes to see how capital vs operating requests are treated.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, board minutes show intent. I will also check the warehouse rule changes to see if scope freezes actually hold.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, the scheduling trial is a good start. I will also look at the upgrade history of the dispatch tool to see how we handle aging systems.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the dispatch tool is old, but the people are older. I will also check the depot supervisors and the last rollout to see how training sticks.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I will examine the yard devices and the 2021 scheduling trial. I need to know if our hardware can survive the change.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will examine the five years of renewal invoices and the board minutes on capital and operating requests. I need to see the true cost curve.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will examine support ownership during last winter's outage and the warehouse rule changes after new accounts. I need to see where control breaks.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I will examine the data lift in the 2018 pay move and the upgrade history of the dispatch tool. I need to see how we handle transitions and aging tech.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I will examine administrator retirements and hiring times and the depot supervisors and the last rollout. I need to see who is left to carry the weight.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
